2. Compute 24-month rolling mean & anomaly multiples: Using the CSV, for each (region × product_line) compute the 24-month trailing mean of monthly sales, then compute the ratio = current_month_sales / 24-month_mean for every month. Save the full result table to a CSV file (e.g. offline_data/anomaly_multiples.csv) → code_agent
