5. Write Markdown report with embedded data: Write a comprehensive Markdown report to offline_data/regional_sales_anomaly_report.md. Requirements: (1) H1 title; (2) at least one data table showing top-3 anomalies with multiples, months, return rates; (3) every key number annotated with source in format '（来源：offline_data/regional_sales.csv 的 <列名>，<聚合口径与样本行数>）' or '（来源：由前述两行计算）'; (4) a concluding paragraph judging real demand vs channel stuffing for each anomaly; (5) all conclusions derived solely from the local CSV. Embed the data tables inline (no separate attachments) → code_agent
